<tr style="background:#eef2ff;"><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;font-weight:600;">AU — Audit &amp; Accountability</td><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;">Immutable hardware change tracking, credential vault chain of custody, federation event and heartbeat logging</td></tr>
<tr style="background:#f8fafc;"><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;font-weight:600;">IA — Identification &amp; Authentication</td><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;">TOTP 2FA with platform-level enforcement, signed short-lived sessions, mTLS for every federation link</td></tr>
