<tr style="background:#f8fafc;"><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;font-weight:600;">CM — Configuration Management</td><td style="border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:9px 13px;color:#000;">Firmware baseline compliance, policy sync with conflict detection, site autonomy enforcement</td></tr>
